@using Ibtikar.Controllers
@using Ibtikar.ViewModels
@using static Ibtikar.Services.Helpers.KsaTime
@model AdminOverviewVm
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "نظرة عامة على النظام";
    var currentStatus = Model.StatusFilter ?? string.Empty;
}

<div class="bog-main">
    <div class="container py-4">
        <div class="bog-page-header">
            <h1>
                <span class="bog-page-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                    <span class="material-icons">assessment</span>
                </span>
                <span class="bog-page-title">نظرة عامة على النظام</span>
                <span class="bog-page-role">
                    <span class="material-icons" aria-hidden="true">person</span>
                    مدير النظام
                </span>
            </h1>
            <div class="bog-header-actions">
                <a class="btn btn-outline-info btn-sm" asp-controller="Reports" asp-action="Index">
                    <span class="material-icons align-middle" style="font-size:18px">insights</span>
                    <span>التقارير الزمنية</span>
                </a>
                <a class="btn btn-outline-info btn-sm" asp-controller="Reports" asp-action="Challenges">
                    <span class="material-icons align-middle" style="font-size:18px">report_problem</span>
                    <span>تقرير التحديات</span>
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="alert alert-light border d-flex align-items-start gap-2 mb-4" data-testid="admin-readonly-note">
            <span class="material-icons text-muted">info</span>
            <div class="text-muted small">
                <strong>ملاحظة:</strong> لوحة مدير النظام للقراءة فقط. لا توجد إجراءات تعديل من هذه الصفحة.
                للوصول إلى الإحصاءات التفصيلية، استخدم التقارير في الأعلى.
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="row g-3 mb-4">
            <div class="col-md-3 col-sm-6">
                <div class="card h-100 bog-kpi-card" data-testid="kpi-total">
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <div class="bog-kpi-label">إجمالي الأفكار</div>
                        <div class="bog-kpi-value">@Model.TotalIdeas</div>
                        <div class="bog-kpi-meta">جميع الحالات</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-3 col-sm-6">
                <div class="card h-100 bog-kpi-card" data-testid="kpi-drafts">
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <div class="bog-kpi-label">المسودات</div>
                        <div class="bog-kpi-value text-warning">@Model.Drafts</div>
                        <div class="bog-kpi-meta">غير مُرسلة بعد</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-3 col-sm-6">
                <div class="card h-100 bog-kpi-card" data-testid="kpi-submitted">
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <div class="bog-kpi-label">المُرسلة</div>
                        <div class="bog-kpi-value text-success">@Model.Submitted</div>
                        <div class="bog-kpi-meta">في دورة المراجعة</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-3 col-sm-6">
                <div class="card h-100 bog-kpi-card" data-testid="kpi-users">
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <div class="bog-kpi-label">المستخدمون النشطون</div>
                        <div class="bog-kpi-value">@Model.TotalUsers</div>
                        <div class="bog-kpi-meta">من جميع الأدوار</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        @{
            var allIdeasCount = Model.ByStatus.Sum(s => s.Count);
        }
        <div class="row g-3 mb-4">
            <div class="col-lg-2">
                <div class="card bog-section h-100">
                    <div class="card-header bg-white d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                        <span class="material-icons text-primary">donut_large</span>
                        <strong class="fs-6">تصنيف بالحالة</strong>
                    </div>
                    <div class="card-body p-0">
                        <a asp-action="Index" class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center py-2 px-3 border-bottom text-decoration-none text-body" style="@(string.IsNullOrEmpty(currentStatus) ? "background-color:var(--brand-50,#F3FCF6);font-weight:600" : null)">
                            <span class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                                <span class="bog-status-dot" style="background-color:#0d6efd"></span>
                                الكل
                            </span>
                            <span class="fw-semibold">@allIdeasCount</span>
                        </a>
                        @foreach (var s in Model.ByStatus)
                        {
                            var isActive = string.Equals(currentStatus, s.Code, StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase);
                            <a asp-action="Index" asp-route-status="@s.Code"
                               class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center py-2 px-3 border-bottom text-decoration-none text-body" style="@(isActive ? "background-color:var(--brand-50,#F3FCF6);font-weight:600" : null)">
                                <span class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                                    <span class="bog-status-dot" style="background-color:@s.Color"></span>
                                    @s.Name
                                </span>
                                <span class="fw-semibold">@s.Count</span>
                            </a>
                        }
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-lg-10">
                <div class="card bog-section">
                    <div class="card-header bg-white d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                        <span class="material-icons text-primary align-middle">list_alt</span>
                        <strong>سجل الأفكار</strong>
                        <span class="badge bg-secondary">@Model.IdeasTotalCount</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="card-body p-0">
                        @if (!Model.Ideas.Any())
                        {
                            <div class="text-center text-muted p-5">
                                <span class="material-icons" style="font-size:48px;color:var(--text-muted)">inbox</span>
                                <p class="mb-1 mt-2">لا توجد أفكار بهذه التصنيف.</p>
                            </div>
                        }
                        else
                        {
                            <div class="bog-mobile-cards d-md-none">
                                @foreach (var i in Model.Ideas)
                                {
                                    <div class="bog-idea-card" data-testid="admin-idea-card">
                                        <div class="bog-idea-card__head">
                                            <span class="bog-idea-card__status" style="--chip-bg:@i.StatusColor">
                                                <span class="bog-idea-card__status-dot" style="background-color:@i.StatusColor"></span>
                                                @i.StatusName
                                            </span>
                                        </div>
                                        <h3 class="bog-idea-card__title">@i.Title</h3>
                                        <div class="bog-idea-card__foot">
                                            <small class="bog-idea-card__date">
                                                <span class="material-icons" style="font-size:14px">person</span>
                                                @i.ApplicantName
                                            </small>
                                            <small class="bog-idea-card__date">
                                                <span class="material-icons" style="font-size:14px">event</span>
                                                @i.CreatedAt.FormatDate()
                                            </small>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="mt-2">
                                            <a class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-primary" asp-action="Details" asp-route-id="@i.Id">
                                                <span class="material-icons align-middle" style="font-size:14px">visibility</span>
                                                تفاصيل
                                            </a>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                }
                            </div>
                            <div class="table-responsive d-none d-md-block bog-table-no-hscroll">
                                <table class="bog-card-list mb-0" data-testid="admin-ideas-table">
                                    <colgroup>
                                        <col style="width:26%" />
                                        <col style="width:12%" />
                                        <col style="width:17%" />
                                        <col style="width:14%" />
                                        <col style="width:11%" />
                                        <col style="width:20%" />
                                    </colgroup>
                                    <thead>
                                        <tr>
                                            <th>العنوان</th>
                                            <th>المجال</th>
                                            <th>المُقدِّم</th>
                                            <th>الإدارة المحالة</th>
                                            <th>الحالة</th>
                                            <th class="text-end">تاريخ التقديم</th>
                                        </tr>
                                    </thead>
                                    <tbody>
                                        @foreach (var i in Model.Ideas)
                                        {
                                            <tr>
                                                <td data-label="العنوان">
                                                    <span class="bog-idea-title" title="@i.Title">@i.Title</span>
                                                </td>
                                                <td data-label="المجال"><small>@i.DomainName</small></td>
                                                <td data-label="المُقدِّم">
                                                    <span class="bog-idea-title">@i.ApplicantName</span>
                                                    <small class="text-muted d-block">@i.ApplicantDepartmentName</small>
                                                </td>
                                                <td data-label="الإدارة المحالة"><small>@(i.AssignedDepartmentName ?? "—")</small></td>
                                                <td data-label="الحالة"><span class="badge rounded-pill" style="background-color:@i.StatusColor">@i.StatusName</span></td>
                                                <td class="bog-card-list__actions" data-label="تاريخ التقديم">
                                                    <div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between gap-2">
                                                        <small dir="ltr">@i.CreatedAt.FormatDate()</small>
                                                        <a class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-primary" asp-action="Details" asp-route-id="@i.Id">
                                                            <span class="material-icons align-middle" style="font-size:14px">visibility</span>
                                                            تفاصيل
                                                        </a>
                                                    </div>
                                                </td>
                                            </tr>
                                        }
                                    </tbody>
                                </table>
                            </div>
                        }
                        @if (Model.Ideas.Any())
                        {
                            <div class="p-2 border-top bg-white">
                                @await Html.PartialAsync("_Pagination", null,
                                    new ViewDataDictionary(ViewData)
                                    {
                                        { "Page", Model.Page },
                                        { "PageSize", Model.PageSize },
                                        { "TotalCount", Model.IdeasTotalCount }
                                    })
                            </div>
                        }
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
